# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cal.com booking link used by the appointment section.
#
# Format: <username>/<event-slug>   e.g. johnvenice-almazan-qruh8a/30min
# This is a PUBLIC booking link, NOT a secret / API key.
#
# • Leave it set  -> the section renders the real Cal.com booking widget.
# • Set it blank  -> the section renders the built-in interactive mock stepper.
#
# A sensible default is already baked into src/config.js, so the app works with
# the real embed even without this file. Copy this to `.env` only to OVERRIDE it
# (e.g. to point at a dedicated "Oil Boiler Service" event type once created).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_CAL_LINK=johnvenice-almazan-qruh8a/30min
